  "description": "Bulk-update Field Service Bookable Resource settings across many resources at once: Start/End Location, Organizational Unit, Display on Schedule Board, Enable for Availability Search, Hourly Rate and Time Off Approval; set work hours by weekly pattern or by copying another resource's calendar; and quick add/remove skills (characteristics) and territories for everyone selected. Preview every change before applying.",
