  "releaseNotes": "1.0.3 — The interface now matches the other tools in the suite: one compact header, and the same cards, tables and spacing throughout. The tool also no longer switches to a dark theme when it is running inside Dynamics 365 as a web resource — it stays light, like the app around it. This is a visual change only — nothing about how the tool works has changed. 1.0.2 — The interface has been rebuilt in the Fluent 2 design language, so the tool now looks like a modern model-driven app: light in XrmToolBox, dark in Power Platform ToolBox. This is a visual change only — nothing about how the tool works has changed. 1.0.1 — Add \"Field Service – New Mobile Experience\" per-user quick action (assign/remove the security role on selected User resources). 1.0.0 — Initial release.",
  "requireLicenseAcceptance": false,
  "summary": "Bulk-edit Bookable Resource settings, work hours, skills and territories across many Field Service resources.",
